WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
[A printing press runs]
History has a pulse. Austin, Texas.

00:04.000 --> 00:07.000
[Shop machinery turns]
A working shop. A trade, carried forward.

00:07.000 --> 00:10.000
[Paper moves through shop equipment]
Printed here. Thomas Graphics, Austin.

00:10.000 --> 00:15.200
Give history a place on your wall.
Thomas Broadside Co. thomasbroadside.co
